source, the same in a source checkout and a binary install. The prompt names the
policy file it needs and reads the default, then the project''s own on top.', NULL, NULL, '{}'::text[], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'policy', 'triage/scripts/policy.ts', 'bun', NULL, NULL, 'archon-triage-block', 'triage/archon-triage-block.yaml');
INSERT INTO mc.arch_steps (archon_sha, factory_sha, workflow, path, parent_path, position, step_id, kind, description, model, when_condition, depends_on, trigger_rule, include, child_workflow, round_cap, command, command_file, script, script_file, runtime, bash, prompt, defined_in, file) VALUES ('abd85896e7971c9ac5199ed7e87973f27130250f', '6311108f789119a8a1a6a7c77ece21ca3a75c3e8', 'archon-triage-block', 'triage', NULL, 1, 'triage', 'command', NULL, 'medium', NULL, ARRAY['policy']::text[], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'triage', 'triage/commands/triage.md', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'archon-triage-block', 'triage/archon-triage-block.yaml');
INSERT INTO mc.arch_steps (archon_sha, factory_sha, workflow, path, parent_path, position, step_id, kind, description, model, when_condition, depends_on, trigger_rule, include, child_workflow, round_cap, command, command_file, script, script_file, runtime, bash, prompt, defined_in, file) VALUES ('abd85896e7971c9ac5199ed7e87973f27130250f', '6311108f789119a8a1a6a7c77ece21ca3a75c3e8', 'archon-triage-block', 'verdict', NULL, 2, 'verdict', 'script', 'The prompt judges; this boundary flattens the decision into the fields every
caller reads, checks what a schema cannot (blockers are qualified URLs) and
backstops the rest, and
derives the pack''s labels here rather than
chosen by the model: one state label and one type label, plus a size label
while the item can still be worked. Each field''s own type and vocabulary were certified on the
node above. Labels are written only under publish, after the item''s identity
is verified on the tracker, and read back before the node reports them.', NULL, NULL, ARRAY['triage']::text[], NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'verdict', 'triage/scripts/verdict.ts', 'bun', NULL, NULL, 'archon-triage-block', 'triage/archon-triage-block.yaml');
